#################################################################################
## CI Workflows
##
## Lists every workflow the CI workflow (ci.yml) calls, and the files each one
## depends on. Read by the plan-ci action.
##
## Format:
##   - '<workflow>: <pattern>...', where <workflow> is the file name without
##     '.yml' (and the job id in ci.yml), and each <pattern> is a glob:
##     '*' and '?' stop at '/', '**' crosses directories.
##   - A workflow may span several lines; its patterns are combined.
##   - A workflow with no patterns only runs for PRs, tags and manual runs.
##
## Effect:
##   - On a branch push, a workflow runs when a file matching one of its
##     patterns changed since it last succeeded, or when its last result
##     wasn't a success.
#################################################################################

